====Synonyms====
* [[sincere]]; real; unfeigned; undissembled; cordial; earnest; warm; zealous; ardent; eager; active; vigorous.<!-- Hearty, Cordial, Sincere. Hearty implies honesty and simplicity of feelings and manners; cordial refers to the warmth and liveliness with which the feelings are expressed; sincere implies that this expression corresponds to the real sentiments of the heart. A man should be hearty in his attachment to his friends, cordial in his reception of them to his house, and sincere in his offers to assist them. (Page: 679)-->

